    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i'm just watching a movie of someone else's life. like, i look in the mirror and i recognize the face, but i don't actually feel like it's mine. i'm just drifting and everything feels so thin and hollow. like i'm slowly disappearing and there's nothing left inside.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
